**Unnamed project** is a small-scale open-world sandbox with the freedom and mischief of a city crime game, transported to a slower, warmer corner of the Polish countryside.

Roam the village and its surroundings, take on odd jobs, meet local characters and make your own small trouble. The world is compact enough to feel familiar, but open enough to let a quiet afternoon turn into a story.

It is a game about coming back, finding your rhythm and seeing how much can happen in an ordinary place.
